sequenceDiagram
  participant User as 教师/专家/学生
  participant FE as 用户端报告页
  participant BE as Spring Boot后端
  participant AI as AI Jury服务
  participant DB as MySQL

  User->>FE: 点击发起评审团复核
  FE->>BE: POST /api/ai-score/sessions/{sessionId}/jury/start
  BE->>DB: 创建 ai_jury_session
  BE->>AI: 发送基础报告和证据快照
  AI->>AI: 按 persona 生成多份评审报告
  AI->>AI: 聚合分数、分歧、共识和建议
  AI->>BE: 回写成员报告和聚合报告
  BE->>DB: 写入 ai_jury_member/ai_judge_report/ai_jury_aggregate
  FE->>BE: GET /api/ai-score/sessions/{sessionId}/jury/result
  BE-->>FE: 返回复核结果
